  "scope": "144 documented Help Scout Mailbox API operations, re-derived 2026-08-07 from the 146 endpoint pages listed in the shared left-nav of developer.helpscout.com/mailbox-api/ (Help Scout publishes no machine-readable spec; the ledger's recorded .../mailbox-api/endpoints/ URL 404s and is a section prefix, not a page). Each page renders exactly one METHOD+path request line. Deduped on the TEMPLATED path each page publishes in its own Path Parameters block, never on the example URL: 146 pages collapse to 144 operations because original-source is documented once per Accept header and DELETE /v2/customers/{customerId} is documented once with and once without ?async=true. Method split GET 79 / POST 21 / PUT 20 / PATCH 6 / DELETE 18. Every row carries exactly one disposition. The five Mailbox API v3 operations are recorded at their documented host-root path because they lie outside this bundle's /v2 base. Webhook events are excluded by the counting policy and live at developer.helpscout.com/webhooks/; the five /v2/webhooks management endpoints are ordinary operations and are counted.",
